        "values": {
          "en": "A constant context records the free constant symbols available to an untyped λ-term. Unlike variables introduced by λ-abstraction, these constants are not captured by λ-binders.",
          "zh-CN": "常量语境记录无类型 λ-项可以使用的自由常量符号。与 λ-抽象引入的变量不同，这些常量不会被 λ-绑定子捕获。"
        }
